---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>
    <strong>Early Chinese Legal Documents Workshop</strong>
</h1>

<p>
        The <em>Early Chinese Legal Documents Workshop</em> is a series of reading groups and talks for scholars working with primary sources of early Chinese legal history. We take turns to lead the reading and discussion of early Chinese legal documents, with a focus on legal cases from <strong>unearthed Qin and Han manuscripts</strong>. We welcome faculty members and PhD students from across the world to participate.

      </p>

      <p>
        The workshop is held every two weeks online on <strong>Friday, 9-11 AM, U.S. Eastern Time</strong>. Discussions are bilingual, in English and Mandarin.
      </p>

      <h2>For more information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
  Contact us: 
  Prof. Liang Cai (<a href="mailto:lcai@nd.edu">lcai@nd.edu</a>)
  or Prof. Yunxin Li (<a href="mailto:yunxin.li@simmons.edu">yunxin.li@simmons.edu</a>).
</li>
        <li>Check our <a href="/post/">Posts</a> for materials and updates, and 
  <a href="/about/">About</a> for workshop formats.</li>
  <li>
  Maintainer: Wenjie Hua (<a href="mailto:wh583@georgetown.edu">wh583@georgetown.edu</a>).
</li>
      </ul>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
</html>
